# Topic5 case-local ignores (repo-root .gitignore already blocks assets_from_customer/ and *.db)

# 运行期事实（引擎落盘：tasks/{task}/runs/{run}/ 下的 run.json/artifacts/attempts）
ma-workspaces/
**/ma-workspaces/

# 技能私密凭据与本地配置（后续波次移植 datahub/ssjh/cos/cover 时带入）
skills/**/.env
skills/**/config.json
!skills/**/config.example.json

# 技能本地产出与缓存
skills/**/Outputs/
tools/out/*.zip
tools/out/*.sha256

# ECharts 中文字体体积约 16 MiB/个，不进入 Git；部署前按 fonts/README.md 本地放置。
ma-resources/skills/blueai-yuqing-echarts-skill-new/assets/fonts/*.otf

# Python 缓存
**/__pycache__/
*.pyc
